[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/world/forms/spin_sails.gd" id="1_spin"]

; The Reality form of the windmill: the mill of Montiel.
;
; Reference: docs/reference/venture_of_montiel_concept_sheet.jpg
;
; A round tower of ochre limestone, polished smooth by the grain, with a
; low doorway at the base and four tattered canvas sails on an iron
; axle. The door is a weak point: the Venture of Montiel is fought at
; its foot, and the foot is the door.
;
; Low-poly and flat: eight-sided cylinders and boxes, the palette of the
; game. The whole thing is under 200 triangles.

